    <h2 align="center"><strong>Fourth National Conference  on Space Science &amp; Technology (NCSS&amp;T-2016)</strong></h2>
  <p align="justify">The Institute of Space and Planetary  Astrophysics, University of Karachi is organizing the Fourth National  Conference on Space Science on October 7-9, 2016 at University of Karachi for  celebrating &quot;World Space Week 2016&quot;. This conference is being  organized in collaboration with SUPARCO and Higher Education Commission. The  main theme of the Conference is &ldquo;<strong>Frontiers  of Space Science &amp; Applications</strong>&rdquo;. The Vice Chancellor, Prof. Dr.  Muhammad Qaiser will preside while Dean, Faculty of Science, Prof. Dr. Syed Afrozuddin Ahmed will also be present at this occasion.</p>
  <p align="justify"><strong>The invited speakers are Prof. Dr. Asghar Qadir (</strong>Hilal-e-Imtiaz &amp;  Sitara-e-Imtiaz<strong>)</strong><strong> from NUST, Islamabad; Prof. Dr. Ghulam Murtaza (Sitara-e-Imtiaz) from GC  University, Lahore; Prof. Dr. Muhammad Sharif (Tamgha-e-Imtiaz) from University  of Punjab; Prof. Dr. Hamid Saleem from Institute of Space Technology,  Islamabad;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Prof. Dr. Haleem Zaman Magsi from<strong> </strong><strong>Karakoram International University, Gilgit</strong><strong>; Dr.  Khan Alam from University of Peshawar; </strong>Dr. Amna Mir and Dr. Zahida Ehsan from COMSATS Institute of  Information Technology, Lahore; Dr. Safia Zahid from COMSATS Institute of  Information Technology, Islamabad; Dr. Gulzar Khan from Abdul Wali khan University Mardan, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa<strong>; Prof. Dr. M. Ayub Khan Yousufzai and Prof. Dr. Syed Jamil H. Kazmi from  University of Karachi. </strong>Prof. Dr. M. Jawed Iqbal is the  Conference Convener, Dr. Mirza Jawwad Baig is the Secretary, Mr. Faisal Ahmed  Khan Afridi is the Joint Secretary, Mr. Syed Faisal-ur-Rehman is the Assistant  Secretary while 11 other members are included in the Conference Organizing  Committee.</p>
  
