<h2 align="center"><strong>Third National Conference on Space Science & Technology (NCSS&T-2015) </strong></h2>
  <p align="justify">The Institute of Space and Planetary  Astrophysics, University of Karachi was organized the Third National Conference  on Space Science &amp; Technology on October 5 &amp; 6, 2015 at HEJ Auditorium,  University of Karachi for celebrating &quot;World Space Week 2015&quot;. This  conference was organized in collaboration with SUPARCO and Higher Education  Commission. The main theme of the Conference is &ldquo;Deep  Space Discoveries&rdquo;. </p>
  <p align="justify">Mr. Syed Nasir Hussain Shah, Minister  for Local Bodies, Govt. of Sindh was the Chief Guest of the Inaugural ceremony.  Dr Sajid Mirza, Member Space Science &amp;  Technology, SUPARCO, was the chief guest of the Closing Ceremony. Prof. Dr.  Hafeez-ur-Rehman Hoorani, Director General, National Centre for Physics,  Islamabad and Hilton Pharma Ltd&rsquo;s Chairman, Mr. Sardar Yasin Malik were also present  as Special guest in the Closing Ceremony. The Vice Chancellor, Prof. Dr.  Muhammad Qaiser presided the Conference while Dean, Faculty of Science, Prof.  Dr. Syed Arif Kamal&nbsp;was also present at this  occasion.</p>
  <p align="justify">The invited speakers were Prof.  Dr. Charles Timothy Spracklen from Habib University, Karachi; Prof. Dr. Asghar  Qadir (Hilal-e-Imtiaz  &amp; Sitara-e-Imtiaz) from NUST, Islamabad; Prof. Dr. Muhammad Sharif  (Tamgha-e-Imtiaz) from University of Punjab; Prof. Dr. Qamar-ul-Islam, Prof. Dr.  Hamid Saleem and Dr. Najam Abbas Naqvi from Institute of Space Technology,  Islamabad;&nbsp; Prof.  Dr. Suhail Zaki Farooqui  from Pakistan Council for Renewable Technologies, Islamabad ;  Dr. Saeed-ur-Rehman from  PINSTECH, Islamabad; Dr. Khan Alam from University of Peshawar; Dr. Mubasher  Jamil from NUST, Islamabad; Dr. M. Fraz Bashir from G.C. University, Lahore; Prof.  Dr. Asim-ur-Rehman from FAST-NUCES, Karachi; Dr. Alia Bano Munshi from PCSIR  Laboratories Complex, Karachi; Prof. Dr. Badar Munir Khan Ghauri from Institute  of Space Technology, Karachi; Prof. Dr. M. Ayub Khan Yousufzai from University  of Karachi. </p>
  <p>Paper presenters were  from the University of Punjab, Lahore; COMSAT, Lahore; Institute of Space  Technology, Islamabad; NUST, Islamabad; PINSTECH, Islamabad; Pakistan Council  of Renewable Energy Technologies, Islamabad; SUPARCO; Habib University,&nbsp;Karachi; Iqra University,&nbsp;Karachi; Hamdard University,&nbsp;Karachi; PCSIR&nbsp;Laboratories&nbsp;Complex,&nbsp;Karachi; NUST, Karachi; NED University  of Engg. &amp; Technology; FAST-NUCES,&nbsp;Karachi;  Institute of Space Technology,&nbsp;Karachi;  Sir Syed University of Engg. &amp; Technology and University of&nbsp;Karachi. A large number of students,  faculty members, scientists and professionals attended the Conference and fully  benefited from the outcome of technical discussions. <strong>More  than 50 </strong>research papers were presented in the Conference. Prof.  Dr. M. Jawed Iqbal was the Conference Convener, Dr. Mirza Jawwad Baig was the  Secretary, Dr. Saqib-ur-Rehman was the Joint Secretary, Mr. Faisal Ahmed Khan  Afridi and Mr. Syed Faisal-ur-Rehman was the Assistant Secretary while 13 other  members were included in the Conference Organizing Committee.</p>
