<h2 align="center"><strong>Second National Conference on Space Science (NCSS-2013)</strong></h2>
  <p align="justify">The  Institute of Space Science and Technology, University of Karachi was  organized the Second National Conference on Space  Science on October 7 &amp; 8, 2013 at HEJ Auditorium, University of Karachi for  celebrating &quot;World Space Week 2013&quot;. This conference was organized in  collaboration with SUPARCO, HEJ Research Institute of Chemistry, Higher  Education Commission and Pakistan Physical Society, Sindh Chapter. The main  theme of the Conference is &ldquo;Exploring the Universe&rdquo;. The Chief Guest was the Emeritus Professor, Dr Atta-ur-Rehman, who&nbsp;inaugurated the inaugural ceremony of two days  National Conference on Space Science at University of Karachi.&nbsp;The Dean, Faculty  of Science, Prof. Dr. Abid Azhar was presided the Inaugural Ceremony.&nbsp;The Chief Guest of  the Closing ceremony was the Eminent Atomic  Scientist, Dr. Abdul Qadeer Khan. Prof.  Dr. Faizullah Abbasi,  Vice Chancellor, Dawood  University of Engineering &amp; Technology, Karachi was the special  Guest of the ceremony. </p>
  <p><strong>The invited speakers were </strong>Prof. Dr. Ghulam Murtaza (Sitara-e-Imtiaz) from GC University, Lahore;  Prof. Dr. Asghar Qadir (Hilal-e-Imtiaz &amp; Sitara-e-Imtiaz) from NUST,  Islamabad; Prof. Dr. Muhammad Sharif (Tamgha-e-Imtiaz) from University of  Punjab; Prof. Dr. Sarwar Naqvi &amp; Dr. Fazeel Mahmood Khan from Institute of  Space Technology, Islamabad; Dr. S. M. Ahmad from GIK Institute of Engineering  Sciences and Technology, Topi; Prof. Dr. FaheemUddin, Faculty of Engineering,  Baluchistan University of I.T. Engineering and Management Sciences, Quetta; Dr.  Syed Javaid Khurshid from International Nathiagali Summer College; Dr. Saleha  N. Habibullah from Kinnaird College For Women, Lahore; Dr. Adnan Maqsood from  NUST, Islamabad; Dr. Khan Alam and Dr. Muhammad Shafique from University of  Peshawar; Dr. Adnan Khan from LUMS; Dr. Gulzar Khan from Abdul Wali Khan  University, Mardan; Prof. Dr. M. Ayub Khan Yousufzai and Prof. Dr. Syed Jamil  H. Kazmi from University of Karachi. Total 60 research papers were presented in the  Conference. Dr. M. Jawed Iqbal was the Conference Convener, Mr. Faisal Ahmed  Khan Afridi was the Secretary, Mr. Syed Faisal-ur-Rehman was the Joint  Secretary, Mr. Mirza Jawwad Baig was the Assistant Secretary while 12 other  members were included in the Conference Organizing Committee.</p>
  
